"""The FoxESS private blocks beyond the two curated ones.

Generated from the datalogger's own frontend field catalog against the
captured image of the reference unit (Smart WiLAN 1.11.005 bridging an
AIO-H1-9.6-US); see tests/test_data/fox_wilan.json for the capture and
vendors/foxess.py for the curated subset with cross-checked scales.
Everything here is read-only and diagnostic: a settings mirror and
debug surface, not dashboard material. Fields the catalog names but
this firmware does not serve are absent, not zero. The on/off toggles
the datalogger marks 0xAA / 0x55 decode as such; everything else stays
raw where no scale was cross-checked.
"""

